<mxCell id="da_hk_b1" value="• &lt;b&gt;Zero Recurrent State (model_hooks.py):&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;family=None&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;CONV_CONTEXT=0&lt;/code&gt;. &lt;b&gt;fork&lt;/b&gt; (+K Radix ref) and &lt;b&gt;rewind(k)&lt;/b&gt; (cursor reset c&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt;) are pure O(1) PagedAttention pointer ops." style="rounded=1;arcSize=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#064E3B;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="968" y="330" width="588" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="da_hk_b2" value="• &lt;b&gt;Sparse Retrieval-Layer Mount (kv_mount.py):&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;OCTOPUS_MOUNT_LAYERS&lt;/code&gt; splices sibling KV c&lt;sub&gt;A&lt;/sub&gt;[s:e) into 9 retrieval layers while &lt;code&gt;hide_mounts&lt;/code&gt; keeps 27 layers on B&apos;s own path (&lt;b&gt;96.9% agreement&lt;/b&gt;)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#064E3B;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="968" y="378" width="588" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
